<div id="A1.p5" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p5.1" class="ltx_p">Below, we report detailed results for each model, including calibration metrics. Across all models, we also notice that that the log-likelihood ratios perform better than taking separately the accepted (Cor) or rejected (Incor) model. We find that taking only the hidden states of the generated token (A) gives better results than averaging the hidden states over the question tokens and the generated token (Q+A).</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T3" class="ltx_table">
